HAYE LUT GAYA FATIMA KA GHAR<br>
<br>
 UMME LAILA KA JAWAA SAAL PISAR,<br>
 TUKDE BARCHI SE HUVA JIS KA JIGAR,<br>
 MAA KO KISTARHA SUNAYE YEH KHABAR,<br>
 MARNA JAYE KAHIN WO ROROKAR<br>
<br>
RUN MEIN PAMAAL HUVA IBNE HASAN,<br>
 KHAAQ PAR BAITHI HAI LAMHAO KI DULHAN,<br>
 HAYE KANGNEY KI JAGAH AB HAI RASAN,<br>
 AUR NAHI USKO MAYASAR CHADAR<br>
<br>
TEERAY SEH SHOBHA WO ASGAR KA GALA,<br>
 HAAL AADA SE BHI DEKHA NA GAYA,<br>
 PHAIR KAR ROTE THE SAB MU APNA,<br>
 SHAI NE KIS DIL SE DEKHA MANZAR<br>
<br>
CHAAR SU BIKHREY HAIN RUN MEIN LAASHAY,<br>
 KAHEEN JARRAR KE BAZU HAI PADAY,<br>
 KAUN AAKAR UNHE AB DAFN KARE,<br>
 KAISI GURBATH HAI SABHI LASHAO PAR<br>
<br>
RUN MEIN PAIHAM THI YE SARWAR KI FUGAA,<br>
 AB NA QASIM HAI NA AKBAR SA JAWAA,<br>
 HO CHUKE QATL SABHI QURDOKALA,<br>
 DASHT MEIN AAJ HAI HUU KA MANZAR<br>
<br>
GUNJTI THI YAHI ZEHRA KI SADA,<br>
KUNDH KHANJAR MERE BACHCHAY KA GALA,<br>
 KYA ISI DIN KE LIYE THA PALA,<br>
MERI AAGOOSH MEIN AAJA DILBAR<br>
<br>
HAYE WO SHAAM-E-GARIBAAN KA SAMA,<br>
 THE SABHI KHAIMEY JAHA SHOLA FISHAA,<br>
 HAI PARESHAAN HARAM JAYE KAHAA,<br>
 GASH HAI SAJJAD TO ZAINAB MUZTAR<br>
<br>
THI SAKINA KI FUGAA MERE CHACHA,<br>
 DEKHIYE JAL GAYA MERA KURTA,<br>
 AYE SOHAIL HOGI GASH WO DUKHIYA,<br>
 SHUMR NE CHEEN LIYE JAB GOUHAR..